{"id":"c5e364d61e491828","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-ef-game.md","title":"Ehrenfeucht–Fraïssé 游戏","display":"df-ef-game — Ehrenfeucht–Fraïssé 游戏","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-ef-game","aliases":["29-df-ef-game"],"display":"df-ef-game — Ehrenfeucht–Fraïssé 游戏","depends_on":["[[29-df-struc]]","[[29-df-atomic-formula]]","[[29-df-free-variable]]","[[29-df-satisfaction]]"],"source_locator":"Definition 6.2, pp.91–93, DjVu scans 106–108","source_basis":"用户提供的 DjVu 文本层已独立提取比对；本条实际核对及本地重构范围见 Remark"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-ef-game"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-ef-game</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ef-game — Ehrenfeucht–Fraïssé 游戏"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4de8e0c8085801f5\" href=\"?note=4de8e0c8085801f5\" title=\"29-df-struc\">29-df-struc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"19d380b6c383f76b\" href=\"?note=19d380b6c383f76b\" title=\"29-df-atomic-formula\">29-df-atomic-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"db2b32546860e623\" href=\"?note=db2b32546860e623\" title=\"29-df-free-variable\">29-df-free-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3ee556c64b16809b\" href=\"?note=3ee556c64b16809b\" title=\"29-df-satisfaction\">29-df-satisfaction</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Definition 6.2, pp.91–93, DjVu scans 106–108"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"用户提供的 DjVu 文本层已独立提取比对；本条实际核对及本地重构范围见 Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 为有限词汇，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m,k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m,k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>位置为等长元组 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar a\\in|A|^m\">\\(\\bar a\\in|A|^m\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar b\\in|B|^m\">\\(\\bar b\\in|B|^m\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar x_m=(x_1,\\ldots,x_m)\">\\(\\bar x_m=(x_1,\\ldots,x_m)\\)</span> 为不同变量。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar a^\\frown a\">\\(\\bar a^\\frown a\\)</span> 表示追加一个元素。</li>\n<li>对自由变量限于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar x_m\">\\(\\bar x_m\\)</span> 的原子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\models\\alpha[\\bar a/\\bar x_m]\">\\(A\\models\\alpha[\\bar a/\\bar x_m]\\)</span> 表示任意扩充该局部赋值的全赋值下的真值；因无其他自由变量而与扩充无关。</li>\n<li>每轮先选结构和一个元素，另一方在另一结构回应。以下 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_r^{A,B}\">\\(W_r^{A,B}\\)</span> 递归精确给出剩余 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span> 轮的获胜位置；游戏由两结构、轮数及这些递归位置关系指定。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AtEq}_\\tau(A,\\bar a;B,\\bar b)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_\\tau\\;(\\mathrm{FV}_\\tau(\\alpha)\\subseteq\\{x_1,\\ldots,x_m\\}\\to(A\\models\\alpha[\\bar a/\\bar x_m]\\leftrightarrow B\\models\\alpha[\\bar b/\\bar x_m])).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{AtEq}_\\tau(A,\\bar a;B,\\bar b)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_\\tau\\;(\\mathrm{FV}_\\tau(\\alpha)\\subseteq\\{x_1,\\ldots,x_m\\}\\to(A\\models\\alpha[\\bar a/\\bar x_m]\\leftrightarrow B\\models\\alpha[\\bar b/\\bar x_m])).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"W_0^{A,B}(\\bar a,\\bar b)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{AtEq}_\\tau(A,\\bar a;B,\\bar b).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[W_0^{A,B}(\\bar a,\\bar b)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{AtEq}_\\tau(A,\\bar a;B,\\bar b).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"W_{r+1}^{A,B}(\\bar a,\\bar b)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{AtEq}_\\tau(A,\\bar a;B,\\bar b)\\land(\\forall a\\in|A|\\;\\exists b\\in|B|\\;W_r^{A,B}(\\bar a^\\frown a,\\bar b^\\frown b))\\land(\\forall b\\in|B|\\;\\exists a\\in|A|\\;W_r^{A,B}(\\bar a^\\frown a,\\bar b^\\frown b)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[W_{r+1}^{A,B}(\\bar a,\\bar b)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{AtEq}_\\tau(A,\\bar a;B,\\bar b)\\land(\\forall a\\in|A|\\;\\exists b\\in|B|\\;W_r^{A,B}(\\bar a^\\frown a,\\bar b^\\frown b))\\land(\\forall b\\in|B|\\;\\exists a\\in|A|\\;W_r^{A,B}(\\bar a^\\frown a,\\bar b^\\frown b)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"G_k(A,B)\\coloneqq\\langle A,B,k,(W_r^{A,B})_{0\\leq r\\leq k}\\rangle,\\qquad\\mathrm{Duplicator}\\uparrow G_k(A,B)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ W_k^{A,B}((),()).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[G_k(A,B)\\coloneqq\\langle A,B,k,(W_r^{A,B})_{0\\leq r\\leq k}\\rangle,\\qquad\\mathrm{Duplicator}\\uparrow G_k(A,B)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ W_k^{A,B}((),()).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Definition 6.2，印刷页91–93、扫描页106–108。用完整原子类型检验位置，常量在空位置也已被检测；含函数时原子中的任意项同时检验函数生成子结构，而不误用强制位置域函数闭合的另一种PartIso定义。去掉与第57本书真实签名及语义不兼容的依赖，补齐旧文件没有构造的Move、策略及完整玩法接口。获胜递归是有限完美信息博弈的直接回溯定义，没有无玩法空真问题。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-struc","status":"resolved","id":"4de8e0c8085801f5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-struc]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-atomic-formula","status":"resolved","id":"19d380b6c383f76b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-atomic-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"db2b32546860e623","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-free-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"3ee556c64b16809b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]","display":false},{"tex":"m,k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar a\\in|A|^m","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar b\\in|B|^m","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar x_m=(x_1,\\ldots,x_m)","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar a^\\frown a","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar x_m","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"A\\models\\alpha[\\bar a/\\bar x_m]","display":false},{"tex":"W_r^{A,B}","display":false},{"tex":"r","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{AtEq}_\\tau(A,\\bar a;B,\\bar b)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_\\tau\\;(\\mathrm{FV}_\\tau(\\alpha)\\subseteq\\{x_1,\\ldots,x_m\\}\\to(A\\models\\alpha[\\bar a/\\bar x_m]\\leftrightarrow B\\models\\alpha[\\bar b/\\bar x_m])).","display":true},{"tex":"W_0^{A,B}(\\bar a,\\bar b)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{AtEq}_\\tau(A,\\bar a;B,\\bar b).","display":true},{"tex":"W_{r+1}^{A,B}(\\bar a,\\bar b)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{AtEq}_\\tau(A,\\bar a;B,\\bar b)\\land(\\forall a\\in|A|\\;\\exists b\\in|B|\\;W_r^{A,B}(\\bar a^\\frown a,\\bar b^\\frown b))\\land(\\forall b\\in|B|\\;\\exists a\\in|A|\\;W_r^{A,B}(\\bar a^\\frown a,\\bar b^\\frown b)).","display":true},{"tex":"G_k(A,B)\\coloneqq\\langle A,B,k,(W_r^{A,B})_{0\\leq r\\leq k}\\rangle,\\qquad\\mathrm{Duplicator}\\uparrow G_k(A,B)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ W_k^{A,B}((),()).","display":true}],"bytes":2500,"backlinks":[{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-56","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-df-ef-game]]、[[29-df-pebble-game]] — EF 博弈与卵石博弈"},{"id":"fa169cf9db0afb60","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$G_m$ 与 $\\mathrm{Duplicator}\\uparrow G_m$ 取 [[29-df-ef-game]] 的空初始位置获胜接口；其结构参数包括扩张后全部一元谓词。"},{"id":"da1408963eb3a178","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"0539a14219495918","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Duplicator}\\uparrow G_n(A,B)$ (see [[29-df-ef-game]])"},{"id":"07c3669c44551902","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Duplicator}\\uparrow G_k(A,B)$ (see [[29-df-ef-game]])"},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-53","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-df-ef-game]]"}],"outgoing":["4de8e0c8085801f5","19d380b6c383f76b","db2b32546860e623","3ee556c64b16809b"]}